Issues
===================================

Crash dumps during test create a tombstone file. pull it from device and format the dump with these terminal commands:

cd /Volumes/mnt/Library/Android/platform-tools/
./adb pull /data/tombstones/tombstone_08
../ndk/29.0.14206865/ndk-stack -sym /Volumes/mnt/Library/Android/system-images/android-37.0/google_apis_playstore_ps16k/x86_64 -dump tombstone_08

